      "questionText": "What are the roots of the quadratic equation x² - 7x + 12 = 0?",
      "options": ["x = 3, 4", "x = -3, -4", "x = 2, 6", "x = 1, 12"],
      "correctAnswerIndex": 0,
      "explanation": "Factoring x² - 7x + 12 = (x - 3)(x - 4) = 0 yields x = 3 and x = 4."
