      "options": ["20x³ - 6x", "20x⁴ - 6x²", "5x³ - 3x", "20x³ + 6x"],
      "correctAnswerIndex": 0,
      "explanation": "Applying power rule: d/dx(5x⁴) = 20x³, d/dx(-3x²) = -6x, d/dx(9) = 0."
