      "options": ["2x³ + x² + C", "3x³ + x² + C", "6x³ + 2x² + C", "x³ + 2x² + C"],
      "correctAnswerIndex": 0,
      "explanation": "∫ 6x² dx = 2x³, ∫ 2x dx = x². So total = 2x³ + x² + C."
